{"slug":"tintype-services","title":"Tintype Services","nav":"Tintype Services","desc":"All proceeds go towards Penumbra’s programming.","img":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1727384972974-GKWBQQ46E5ZBGDV39IPC/2024_08_C_Shaffer002.jpg","updated":1731615084608,"blocks":[{"t":"text","html":"<h1>Hire our tintype team!</h1><p>Looking to elevate your special day? Penumbra’s mobile tintype booth is perfect for weddings, birthdays, corporate events, craft fairs and beyond. We partner with individuals, party planners, and everything in between. We’ve also worked directly with companies and creative directors on various branded shoots for both online and print.</p><p>For rates and estimates, please email us: <a href=\"mailto:tintype@penumbrafoundation.org?subject=Tintype%20Event%20Inquiry&amp;body=%0A\">tintype@penumbrafoundation.org</a></p>"},{"t":"gallery","imgs":[{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1714591618851-A04QHOSE5WUMOG6YA4F6/AKnox.jpg","alt":"Wedding","cap":"","w":2048,"h":2604},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1714591619537-C822O4B1SDS4RF1AV84D/DWelker072.jpg","alt":"Wedding","cap":"","w":2048,"h":2579},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1714680482999-XAECDZS4BPVWRFEDDIOU/SAM+Cabana+X4.jpg","alt":"Cabana Magazine, 2021","cap":"","w":5487,"h":3898},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1727384737258-1WI9QS95GLDG5HCYOUSB/2024_08_G_Tung001.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 4","cap":"","w":2048,"h":2607},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1727384718682-ORL3CMXERQI0HHLSO62Z/2024_06_M_Byrnes001.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 5","cap":"","w":2048,"h":2560},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1727384723184-IWUBGYRQIM4SBLITCDLO/2024_08_A_DeCrosta001.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 6","cap":"","w":2048,"h":1632},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1727384712881-YF01O5TS74GUB9E2NGIL/2024_03_i_morales_c_swanson_001.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 7","cap":"","w":2048,"h":2879},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1727384998397-FMZIZOUC4UH82MYVW0JU/2024_08_Alex001.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 8","cap":"","w":2048,"h":2600}]},{"t":"text","html":"<h1></h1><h1>What we offer</h1><h3>Weddings</h3><h3>Fairs &amp; Pop-Ups</h3><h3>Branded shoots</h3><ul><li><p>Our team has partnered with wedding planners, creative directors, producers, and various artists for branded content, e-commerce campaigns, and magazine editorials, and more.  </p></li><li><p>Our mobile tintype booth can go anywhere. </p></li><li><p>One photographer can make between 6-8 tintypes per hour. A larger staff with two photographers can accommodate double this amount. </p></li><li><p>Customers will be able to take their tintypes home with them at the end of the day. </p></li><li><p>Retouched scans are available for an extra charge upon request.</p></li></ul>"},{"t":"form","title":"Tintype Services"},{"t":"text","html":"<h3>Some previous events!</h3>"},{"t":"gallery","imgs":[{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1714598166768-3FYKG0RP84TO9WZG9GF4/20190824_JazzAge_Saturday%2823of80%29.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 9","cap":"","w":1024,"h":683},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1714598168628-WFZZ8W321WIMJ56134RO/20190824_JazzAge_Saturday%2852of80%29.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 10","cap":"","w":1024,"h":1536},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1714598670532-U0OP6NR8EFUQN4XA5U95/20190824_JazzAge_Saturday%2871of80%29.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 11","cap":"","w":1024,"h":1536}]},{"t":"text","html":"<p><em>Jazz Age Lawn Party, 2019</em></p>"},{"t":"gallery","imgs":[{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1714761291509-Q3TYNSKLNB0A30VKT123/2018_Ingersoll-4.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 12","cap":"","w":1500,"h":1158},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1714761291509-9SNUZJ9673R1M72DC3BN/2018_Ingersoll-5.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 13","cap":"","w":1500,"h":1157},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1714761292498-BDTYMJ7I3HEV4Z88T7DI/2018_Ingersoll-20.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 14","cap":"","w":1175,"h":1500}]},{"t":"text","html":"<p><em>Ingersoll Watches, 2018</em></p>"},{"t":"gallery","imgs":[{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1731614848720-HT00GIHI1HTQETZRR0XG/degnan_wedding022.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 15","cap":"","w":2048,"h":2530},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1731614865891-4FO39FM32OG611HLGJPY/degnan_wedding013.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 16","cap":"","w":2048,"h":2614},{"src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/55d61c1be4b0cafd401171f5/1731614848924-YGZP85IIYGGWF7110C4O/degnan_wedding032.jpg","alt":"Tintype Services — image 17","cap":"","w":2048,"h":2558}]},{"t":"text","html":"<p><em>Massachusetts Wedding, 2023</em></p>"}]}